ar deneniyor, deneme %1$s \/ %2$s"],"Paused":["Duraklat\u0131ld\u0131"],"We have paused the move":["Ta\u015f\u0131may\u0131 duraklatd\u0131k"],"We could not reach KapsuleHost after %1$s tries (%2$s). Nothing is lost. Everything already copied is still there, and this site has not been changed.":["%1$s denemeden sonra KapsuleHost'a ula\u015famad\u0131k (%2$s). Hi\u00e7bir \u015fey kaybolmad\u0131. Zaten kopyalanan her \u015fey h\u00e2l\u00e2 orada ve bu site de\u011fi\u015ftirilmedi."],"Stopped at":["Durdu\u011fu yer"],"paused at %s":["%s konumunda duraklat\u0131ld\u0131"],"Check this server can reach the internet, then pick up where you left off. Nothing needs to be re-sent.":["Bu sunucunun internete eri\u015febildi\u011fini kontrol edin, sonra kald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z yerden devam edin. Hi\u00e7bir \u015feyin yeniden g\u00f6nderilmesine gerek yok."],"Pick up where it stopped":["Durdu\u011fu yerden devam et"],"Copying your database":["Veritaban\u0131n\u0131z kopyalan\u0131yor"],"The files are across. We are copying your database now, which is usually the quickest part.":["Dosyalar kopyaland\u0131. \u015eimdi veritaban\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 kopyal\u0131yoruz, bu genellikle en h\u0131zl\u0131 k\u0131s\u0131md\u0131r."],"database":["veritaban\u0131"],"finishing":["tamamlan\u0131yor"]}}}